---
title: 信号生命周期
type: sequence
tags: [进程管理, 信号, 系统调用, rt_sigreturn]
description: 从 kill() 发送信号到目标进程执行 handler 并 rt_sigreturn 返回内核的完整流程
---
sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Sender as 发送方进程
    participant Sys as kill() 系统调用
    participant Sig as 内核 signal.c
    participant Target as 目标进程
    participant Arch as 架构层 signal.c
    participant User as 用户态 handler

    Sender->>Sys: kill(pid, sig)
    Sys->>Sig: kill_something_info()
    Sig->>Sig: kill_pid_info() → group_send_sig_info()
    Sig->>Sig: do_send_sig_info() → send_signal_locked()
    Sig->>Sig: __send_signal_locked() 置 pending 位图<br/>complete_signal() 唤醒目标
    Sig-->>Target: 目标置 TIF_SIGPENDING 并唤醒

    Target->>Target: 中断/系统调用返回用户态前<br/>exit_to_user_mode_loop()
    Target->>Sig: get_signal() 取出 pending 信号
    Sig->>Arch: arch_do_signal_or_restart()
    Arch->>Arch: handle_signal(ksig, regs)
    Arch->>Arch: setup_rt_frame() 在用户栈构造 rt_sigframe
    Arch-->>Target: 修改 regs 指向 handler 入口
    Target->>User: 进入 handler 执行
    User->>Arch: handler 返回,调用 rt_sigreturn
    Arch->>Arch: SYSCALL_DEFINE0(rt_sigreturn)<br/>restore_sigcontext() 恢复现场
    Arch-->>Target: 返回被中断的用户态指令继续执行
